 "lines": {
  "zh": [
   [
    4,
    6,
    "hq",
    "鐵鴉一號，停火線就在兩公里外。走過去，戰爭就結束了。"
   ],
   [
    6.5,
    8,
    "hound",
    "結束？戰爭從來不會結束，洛恩。"
   ],
   [
    8.15,
    9.3,
    "ron",
    "那今晚，就由我來結束它。"
   ],
   [
    16,
    17,
    "hound",
    "你還是一樣天真！"
   ],
   [
    20.6,
    21.7,
    "ron",
    "……可惡，動不了……"
   ],
   [
    21.75,
    22.5,
    "hound",
    "結束了，鐵鴉。"
   ],
   [
    23.3,
    24.8,
    "mia",
    "洛恩，趴低！米雅到了！"
   ],
   [
    26,
    27.2,
    "ron",
    "米雅……來得正好！"
   ],
   [
    34.6,
    36,
    "mia",
    "這次你欠我一杯。"
   ],
   [
    36.1,
    37.4,
    "ron",
    "……記帳吧。"
   ]
  ],
  "en": [
   [
    4,
    6,
    "hq",
    "Raven One, the ceasefire line is two clicks out. Walk across and the war is over."
   ],
   [
    6.5,
    8,
    "hound",
    "Over? Wars never end, Ron."
   ],
   [
    8.15,
    9.3,
    "ron",
    "Then tonight I end this one."
   ],
   [
    16,
    17,
    "hound",
    "Still the same fool!"
   ],
   [
    20.6,
    21.7,
    "ron",
    "Damn it... can’t move..."
   ],
   [
    21.75,
    22.5,
    "hound",
    "It’s over, Raven."
   ],
   [
    23.3,
    24.8,
    "mia",
    "Ron, get down! Mia’s here!"
   ],
   [
    26,
    27.2,
    "ron",
    "Mia... perfect timing!"
   ],
   [
    34.6,
    36,
    "mia",
    "You owe me a drink for this one."
   ],
   [
    36.1,
    37.4,
    "ron",
    "...Put it on my tab."
   ]
  ]
 },
